    <title>小茶馆开张啦 🍵</title>
    <url>/2026/10/15/hello-teahouse/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>旧博客只剩下生成好的 HTML，这次干脆从头开了一家新茶馆：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>框架</strong>：Hexo 8 + Butterfly 5（都是目前最新版）</li>
<li><strong>主题</strong>：樱粉奶油配色，支持深色模式、本地搜索、数学公式</li>
<li><strong>写作</strong>：本地 <code>./blog new &quot;标题&quot;</code>，或者打开后台 <code>/admin/</code> 在网页里写</li>
<li><strong>发布</strong>：<code>./blog publish</code> 一条命令</li>
</ul>
<span id="more"></span>
<h2 id="写点代码试试高亮">写点代码试试高亮</h2>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">feed_fish</span>(<span class="params">knowledge: <span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">str</span>]</span>) -&gt; <span class="built_in">str</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;&quot;&quot;往鱼缸里撒知识&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="string">&quot; → &quot;</span>.join(knowledge)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
